Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Stained Glass OS -- `mstsc` in the Run box and from ShellExecute starts our
; Remote Desktop Connection (sg-mstsc), as it would start Microsoft's on
; Windows. Scripts and support tools that call `mstsc /v:host` find it too.
;
; The path is the package's install location reached through Z:. If Z: is ever
; removed from the prefix for isolation, this must move with it.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\App Paths\mstsc.exe]
@="Z:\\usr\\libexec\\stained-glass\\shell\\sg-mstsc64.exe"
